# insar_pipeline - what stays out of the repository.
#
# The repository holds the software only. Client project data never goes in
# it (decision of 16 Oct 2026): it stays on the operator's machine, under the
# projects folder (settings.py: projects_root) or in the ignored files below.
# scripts/check_repo_clean.sh fails if any of it is tracked; CI runs it too.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- client data
# Client project configs and report areas (site coordinates, parcel outlines):
# every project config and every context file except the public layers
# (the example configs left the repository on 28 Oct 2026), so a new client's files stay out without naming them here
configs/config_*.yaml
context/*
!context/SOURCE.txt
!context/cmis_*.geojson
!context/coal_mine*.geojson
# Client numbers pinned by the golden test (tests/test_local_fix_INT.py)
tests/golden_client_numbers.json
# Tests that read real client projects, configs or records: run locally only
tests/test_local_*.py
# The engineering log: client sites, results and coordinates
HANDOFF.md
# Report mock-ups and figure scripts made from client projects
report_assets/
# Stray per-machine files at the package root (a project's bbox and outline)
/config.yaml
/project_zone.geojson
# Archived configs (machine paths, client sites); the runbook beside them stays
configs/archive/*.yaml
configs/archive/*.yml
# Config backups written by the builder and the results viewer
*.bak_*
*.bak

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- records kept locally
# Review records and validation runs (client numbers; the source documents
# behind the truth data are 300+ MB). Kept: the fixed validation protocols and
# the derived truth for the public validation sites, which the experiment
# configs and validation.py read (their sha256s are in configs/experiments/README.md).
review_*/*
!review_2026-10-08/protocol_*.yaml
!review_2026-11-07/protocol_*.yaml
!review_2026-10-08/truth/
review_2026-10-08/truth/*
!review_2026-10-08/truth/*.csv
!review_2026-10-08/truth/*.geojson
!review_2026-10-08/truth/*.json
!review_2026-10-08/truth/README.md
!review_2026-10-08/truth/scripts/
!review_2026-10-08/truth/checks/
review_2026-10-08/truth/checks/*
!review_2026-10-08/truth/checks/*.json
# Hand-made code snapshots from before version control
backups/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- personal / machine
.claude/
*:Zone.Identifier
.netrc
.cdsapirc
*.env
.env*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- build and caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
insar_pipeline_*.tar.gz

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- data products (never in git)
*.h5
*.tif
*.tiff
*.kmz
*.SAFE/
*.zip
*.npz
*.gpkg
.aider*

# graphify knowledge graph (local only)
graphify-out/
